{"id": "70238", "title": "一叶倾晴", "author": "梧桐私语", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70238.htm", "intro": "选男人如同选内裤，不仅样子要好看，更要贴心舒服；\r\n    选男人如同穿内裤，大小合适与否，试了才知道；\r\n    所以，当叶晴遇到韩震这条闷骚黑内裤时，她真心栽了！\r\n    穆中华觉得，爱情这个东西不过是人生路上一段可有可无的无关痛痒，可自从她无意中算计了那个叫叶之远的书呆子后，那人就成了她背上长的小疙瘩，不挠痒、挠了还痒，越挠越痒。最后在她没察觉的时候，她发现原本是给别人下的饵，却被自己咬了钩。\r\n    叶之远笑眯眯的说：这是姜太公钓鱼，怨者上钩，你怨念太深，佛派我来渡你。\r\n    穆中华：哪家的佛管这破事。\r\n    叶之远：欢喜佛。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70238", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "车祸【大修版】", "file": "10902901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "路过【大修版】", "file": "10902902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "际遇【大修版】", "file": "10902903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雪困【大修版】", "file": "10902904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "斗情【大修版】", "file": "10902905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "割舍", "file": "10902906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "表白", "file": "10902907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "腹黑", "file": "10902908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "偷吻", "file": "10902909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "算计", "file": "10902910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温香", "file": "10902911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "劫色", "file": "10902912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "【番外一】色相评估", "file": "10902913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卖身", "file": "10902914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "软玉", "file": "10902915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "斗舞", "file": "10902916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强取", "file": "10902917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "火花", "file": "10902918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "包房", "file": "10902919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "擦枪", "file": "10902920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10903152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10903153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10903154.